      "name": "P",
      "from": null,
      "seed": 54,
      "prompt": "Remove her near-side arm entirely: the whole near grey coat sleeve with its rolled cuff, the bare forearm and the black fingerless glove, so the coat becomes sleeveless on the near side with a neat round armhole seam at the shoulder. No skin and no arm are drawn there. Paint the side panel of the grey coat with its teal piping and pocket, the harness strap and the trousers that were hidden behind the arm, in exactly the same art style and colors. Keep everything else exactly unchanged: the pose, the proportions, the position, the head, the legs and the clothes."
    },
    {
      "name": "C",
      "from": "P",
      "seed": 62,
      "prompt": "Remove the whole grey storm coat completely, including its collar, its white feather lining, its far sleeve, the harness straps and the umbrella on her back. Do not draw the near-side arm: the near shoulder ends in a clean sleeveless armhole of the top, no near arm, no near hand, no skin hanging beside the body. Paint what was behind the coat: a fitted black sleeveless tactical top with a high neck, the belt at the waist and the black cargo trousers over the hips and thighs, in exactly the same art style and colors. Keep everything else exactly unchanged: the pose, the proportions, the position, the head, the legs and the boots."
    }
